{"route":"/docs/4.3/utilities/sizing/","version":"4.3","renderedVersion":"4.3","title":{"id":"content","type":"heading","en":"Sizing","level":1},"lead":{"id":"content--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Easily make an element as wide or as tall with our width and height utilities."},"blocks":[{"id":"relative-to-the-parent","type":"heading","en":"Relative to the parent","level":2},{"id":"relative-to-the-parent--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Width and height utilities are generated from the <code>$sizes</code> Sass map in <code>_variables.scss</code>. Includes support for <code>25%</code>, <code>50%</code>, <code>75%</code>, <code>100%</code>, and <code>auto</code> by default. Modify those values as you need to generate different utilities here."},{"id":"relative-to-the-parent--example-1","type":"demo","key":"b28d6e3622aefb7bc2ec","height":300},{"id":"relative-to-the-parent--code-1","type":"code","value":"<div class=\"w-25 p-3\" style=\"background-color: #eee;\">Width 25%</div>\n<div class=\"w-50 p-3\" style=\"background-color: #eee;\">Width 50%</div>\n<div class=\"w-75 p-3\" style=\"background-color: #eee;\">Width 75%</div>\n<div class=\"w-100 p-3\" style=\"background-color: #eee;\">Width 100%</div>\n<div class=\"w-auto p-3\" style=\"background-color: #eee;\">Width auto</div>","language":"html"},{"id":"relative-to-the-parent--example-2","type":"demo","key":"bf9367aadd2894345591","height":147},{"id":"relative-to-the-parent--code-2","type":"code","value":"<div style=\"height: 100px; background-color: rgba(255,0,0,0.1);\">\n  <div class=\"h-25 d-inline-block\" style=\"width: 120px; background-color: rgba(0,0,255,.1)\">Height 25%</div>\n  <div class=\"h-50 d-inline-block\" style=\"width: 120px; background-color: rgba(0,0,255,.1)\">Height 50%</div>\n  <div class=\"h-75 d-inline-block\" style=\"width: 120px; background-color: rgba(0,0,255,.1)\">Height 75%</div>\n  <div class=\"h-100 d-inline-block\" style=\"width: 120px; background-color: rgba(0,0,255,.1)\">Height 100%</div>\n  <div class=\"h-auto d-inline-block\" style=\"width: 120px; background-color: rgba(0,0,255,.1)\">Height auto</div>\n</div>","language":"html"},{"id":"relative-to-the-parent--paragraph-2","type":"paragraph","en":"You can also use <code>max-width: 100%;</code> and <code>max-height: 100%;</code> utilities as needed."},{"id":"relative-to-the-parent--example-3","type":"demo","key":"7288ba17644216ef7627","height":147},{"id":"relative-to-the-parent--code-3","type":"code","value":"<img src=\"...\" class=\"mw-100\" alt=\"...\">","language":"html"},{"id":"relative-to-the-parent--example-4","type":"demo","key":"9295986474763f8b31b6","height":147},{"id":"relative-to-the-parent--code-4","type":"code","value":"<div style=\"height: 100px; background-color: rgba(255,0,0,0.1);\">\n  <div class=\"mh-100\" style=\"width: 100px; height: 200px; background-color: rgba(0,0,255,0.1);\">Max-height 100%</div>\n</div>","language":"html"},{"id":"relative-to-the-viewport","type":"heading","en":"Relative to the viewport","level":2},{"id":"relative-to-the-viewport--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"You can also use utilities to set the width and height relative to the viewport."},{"id":"relative-to-the-viewport--code-1","type":"code","value":"<div class=\"min-vw-100\">Min-width 100vw</div>\n<div class=\"min-vh-100\">Min-height 100vh</div>\n<div class=\"vw-100\">Width 100vw</div>\n<div class=\"vh-100\">Height 100vh</div>","language":"html"}],"demos":[{"key":"b28d6e3622aefb7bc2ec","html":"\n<div class=\"w-25 p-3\" style=\"background-color: #eee;\">Width 25%</div>\n<div class=\"w-50 p-3\" style=\"background-color: #eee;\">Width 50%</div>\n<div class=\"w-75 p-3\" style=\"background-color: #eee;\">Width 75%</div>\n<div class=\"w-100 p-3\" style=\"background-color: #eee;\">Width 100%</div>\n<div class=\"w-auto p-3\" style=\"background-color: #eee;\">Width auto</div>\n","attrs":{"class":"bd-example"},"sprite":""},{"key":"bf9367aadd2894345591","html":"\n<div style=\"height: 100px; background-color: rgba(255,0,0,0.1);\">\n  <div class=\"h-25 d-inline-block\" style=\"width: 120px; background-color: rgba(0,0,255,.1)\">Height 25%</div>\n  <div class=\"h-50 d-inline-block\" style=\"width: 120px; background-color: rgba(0,0,255,.1)\">Height 50%</div>\n  <div class=\"h-75 d-inline-block\" style=\"width: 120px; background-color: rgba(0,0,255,.1)\">Height 75%</div>\n  <div class=\"h-100 d-inline-block\" style=\"width: 120px; background-color: rgba(0,0,255,.1)\">Height 100%</div>\n  <div class=\"h-auto d-inline-block\" style=\"width: 120px; background-color: rgba(0,0,255,.1)\">Height auto</div>\n</div>\n","attrs":{"class":"bd-example"},"sprite":""},{"key":"7288ba17644216ef7627","html":"\n<svg class=\"bd-placeholder-img mw-100\" width=\"100%\" height=\"100\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMid slice\" focusable=\"false\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Placeholder: Max-width 100%\"><title>Placeholder</title><rect width=\"100%\" height=\"100%\" fill=\"#868e96\"></rect><text x=\"50%\" y=\"50%\" fill=\"#dee2e6\" dy=\".3em\">Max-width 100%</text></svg>\n","attrs":{"class":"bd-example"},"sprite":""},{"key":"9295986474763f8b31b6","html":"\n<div style=\"height: 100px; background-color: rgba(255,0,0,0.1);\">\n  <div class=\"mh-100\" style=\"width: 100px; height: 200px; background-color: rgba(0,0,255,0.1);\">Max-height 100%</div>\n</div>\n","attrs":{"class":"bd-example"},"sprite":""}],"nav":[{"en":"Getting started","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.3/getting-started/introduction/"},{"en":"Introduction","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.3/getting-started/introduction/"},{"en":"Download","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.3/getting-started/download/"},{"en":"Contents","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.3/getting-started/contents/"},{"en":"Browsers & devices","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.3/getting-started/browsers-devices/"},{"en":"JavaScript","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.3/getting-started/javascript